			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":374320,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238977626","appid":374320,"accountid":339019422,"playtime_at_review":9651,"review_text":"Dark Souls III feels like a more refined version of the previous games in many ways. The world is dark and full of strange creatures, and exploring new areas is always interesting, especially when you discover hidden paths...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198299285150\/recommended\/374320\/","votes_up":9}]},{"appid":940230,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238959256","appid":940230,"accountid":329877025,"playtime_at_review":572,"review_text":"very good game if you're into geo-political simulators! the only thing is i think the war system needs improvements and more diplomatic actions and the monthly calculations get annoying. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198290142753\/recommended\/940230\/","votes_up":8},{"recommendationid":"238982850","appid":940230,"accountid":108570836,"playtime_at_review":977,"review_text":"It runs a million times better than Geo-Political Simulator. It still lacks some of the features that game has, but if the developers keep delivering updates at this pace, it could easily become the best game in the...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198068836564\/recommended\/940230\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":4348910,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238988245","appid":4348910,"accountid":100730856,"playtime_at_review":1539,"review_text":"I am a humble water dealer. Times were tough... so I put opium in the water to increase sales. It worked. 10\/10 game.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198060996584\/recommended\/4348910\/","votes_up":29},{"recommendationid":"238970721","appid":4348910,"accountid":102828106,"playtime_at_review":1204,"review_text":"such a great game. awesome atmosphere and i love how it wears the SS13 inspiration on its shoulder. this game feels like playing VA-11 Hall-A but instead of being in Glitch City you're a greyshirt breeding diseased rats in...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198063093834\/recommended\/4348910\/","votes_up":14},{"recommendationid":"238996203","appid":4348910,"accountid":99227243,"playtime_at_review":527,"review_text":"I absolutely love this game. The small text warning is very real if you are playing this on steam deck. The text for the rewards on the marketplace screen (purchasable upgrade) are legitimately unreadable. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198059492971\/recommended\/4348910\/","votes_up":6},{"recommendationid":"238971174","appid":4348910,"accountid":59142487,"playtime_at_review":1525,"review_text":"What a fantastic game, its like, Papers Please but a amazing expansion to it, letting you really make your own choices, play your own way, and just... have fun. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198019408215\/recommended\/4348910\/","votes_up":6},{"recommendationid":"239001574","appid":4348910,"accountid":880084687,"playtime_at_review":399,"review_text":"A cozy shopkeeper sim with a cyberpunk work background. it really nailed the cyberpunk part as the products really matched those settinglike its very diffcult to get clean water, and you rarely see any real food in the...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198840350415\/recommended\/4348910\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":3818450,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238947679","appid":3818450,"accountid":84862043,"playtime_at_review":340,"review_text":"Almost 6 hours in after day 1 with the game. Been a real fun experience playing on a private server with a buddy so far. Only wanted to leave a review because of all the negative reviews targeting the curse system. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198045127771\/recommended\/3818450\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":3159330,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"239033923","appid":3159330,"accountid":229946477,"playtime_at_review":13583,"review_text":"AC Shadows Yasuke \u2013 Naoe 1579 AD \u2013 1582 AD (Japan: Honshu \u2013 Awaji) I won\u2019t go into too much detail here, but honestly, in my opinion, AC Odyssey remains the best Assassin\u2019s Creed title I have ever played when it comes to...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198190212205\/recommended\/3159330\/","votes_up":13}]},{"appid":3883570,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238947423","appid":3883570,"accountid":228501569,"playtime_at_review":800,"review_text":"Love the game's concept , its quite refreshing and fun also so much replay value! Every run is filled with different chaos and you have some of the best memories with friends. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198188767297\/recommended\/3883570\/","votes_up":12}]},{"appid":1799840,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238947489","appid":1799840,"accountid":348939319,"playtime_at_review":150,"review_text":"So far, great game! No hand holding. No tutorial. No unnecessary explanations. No minimap. Metroidvania elements. If that's your thing, go for it.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198309205047\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":76},{"recommendationid":"238952483","appid":1799840,"accountid":199193060,"playtime_at_review":216,"review_text":"12+ year old steam account, first ever review. This game is a real testament to King\u2019s Field. It feels like a modern day successor, retaining all the charm and atmosphere of the originals, losing their shortcomings and...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198159458788\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":65},{"recommendationid":"238963001","appid":1799840,"accountid":1269498623,"playtime_at_review":354,"review_text":"Everything You Would Love To Have In A King's Field-Like For those that aren't aware, the King's Field series was the IP FromSoft did before the generational Souls games. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199229764351\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":18},{"recommendationid":"239037048","appid":1799840,"accountid":881582889,"playtime_at_review":850,"review_text":"Closer In combat to The Elder Scrolls series than King's Field, but an incredible game, with an incredible amount of content, and a fantastic world and character design that a fan of either series would really enjoy.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198841848617\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"239004334","appid":1799840,"accountid":85927151,"playtime_at_review":446,"review_text":"Queen's Domain is bold enough to ask the question: is it possible to make a Kingsfieldlike with genuinely fun combat? After you get past the initial few hours of the game and obtain weapons that enable you to be very mobile...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198046192879\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"239026239","appid":1799840,"accountid":216633726,"playtime_at_review":616,"review_text":"the person who created this game is an absolute MANIAC. this feels like an open world game except literally every nook and cranny is filled with intuitive secrets, puzzles hinted at in the description of items and rewards...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198176899454\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"238988117","appid":1799840,"accountid":835254459,"playtime_at_review":6105,"review_text":"Amazing game! If you describe the game in general terms, it may sound similar to something like Lunacid, but I do really think Queen's Domain has its own escence, so it's very unique! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198795520187\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"238978186","appid":1799840,"accountid":110530843,"playtime_at_review":390,"review_text":"King's Field 2 if you could fly (short distances). The flight turns the game into somewhat of a metroidvania, while still very much feeling like King's Field if it ran at a reasonable framerate. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198070796571\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"238947673","appid":1799840,"accountid":1497569336,"playtime_at_review":131,"review_text":"this has potential to be one of the best games ever made at least top 25 wow im so amazed at its gameplay and mechanics! crunchy graphics some good boss fights so far and tons of areas to explore! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199457835064\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":9},{"recommendationid":"238952597","appid":1799840,"accountid":252857123,"playtime_at_review":245,"review_text":"4 Hours in and this is already quite a treat of a game! I constantly feel myself at the front of my seat by taking careful moves and not growing too bold with my moves. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198213122851\/recommended\/1799840\/","votes_up":8}]},{"appid":3492120,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238973397","appid":3492120,"accountid":239896046,"playtime_at_review":290,"review_text":"Legion Was Here caught me by surprise. It is a charming game that is quite challenging but will keep you smiling. You play Legion \u2013 a character whose forte is altering his appearance to impersonate others and then inserting...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198200161774\/recommended\/3492120\/","votes_up":7}]},{"appid":3884860,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238975826","appid":3884860,"accountid":67835696,"playtime_at_review":395,"review_text":"Absolutely loved my time with The Wolf Among Us Remastered! I\u2019ve always enjoyed games where your choices influence the story and how characters react to you. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198028101424\/recommended\/3884860\/","votes_up":6},{"recommendationid":"238954187","appid":3884860,"accountid":317977005,"playtime_at_review":244,"review_text":"Telltales Magnum Opus Remakes visuals are fantastic and they include a bunch of deleted scenes and behind the scenes content, for a very good price too","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198278242733\/recommended\/3884860\/","votes_up":7}]},{"appid":4115450,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238998773","appid":4115450,"accountid":1284188311,"playtime_at_review":312,"review_text":"Let's start by saying this game is easily one of the best games released this year!! Combat is madly fun and the combos are crazy, especially boss fights are different and unique! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199244454039\/recommended\/4115450\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"238985021","appid":4115450,"accountid":17949719,"playtime_at_review":307,"review_text":"This game is a master piece. The combat is excellent, the game design isn't too punishing like most games, and the story so far has been interesting. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197978215447\/recommended\/4115450\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"238964838","appid":4115450,"accountid":1289781000,"playtime_at_review":695,"review_text":"I'm having the fun of my life and trust me the game is hard as hell, and I'm a fan of sekiro (the hardest game I've ever played with black myth wukong and software games) i have died to bosses more than 4 times ik it's a...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199250046728\/recommended\/4115450\/","votes_up":4}]},{"appid":2747660,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238956500","appid":2747660,"accountid":12762510,"playtime_at_review":1826,"review_text":"Finally! A \"good\" game. After a week of playing crap after crap game wasting my time and money, I finally found one thats good. It's not some magnum opus of a game. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197973028238\/recommended\/2747660\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":4760480,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"238964181","appid":4760480,"accountid":67152219,"playtime_at_review":337,"review_text":"This game is very much a child of Half-Life 2. linear, extremely atmospheric and full of that familliar Eastern-European archetecture. hearkening from janky glory days of ragdoll physics, there's nothing quite as satisfying...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198027417947\/recommended\/4760480\/","votes_up":7}]}],
